164	/**
165	 * The content of the protected files present in the workspace (tracked, untracked or ignored), for recognising a new
166	 * file that carries it. A new file is carried when it equals a protected file exactly (whatever its size) or shares a
167	 * significant line with one: a trimmed, non-comment line of at least 8 characters. Files inside `.nexus` take part by
